r~~CallsGraph interface~stream_for stream_for proc~stream_for_pcg32 stream_for_pcg32 interface~stream_for->proc~stream_for_pcg32 proc~stream_for_splitmix64 stream_for_splitmix64 interface~stream_for->proc~stream_for_splitmix64 proc~splitmix64_next splitmix64_t%splitmix64_next proc~stream_for_pcg32->proc~splitmix64_next proc~splitmix64_seed splitmix64_t%splitmix64_seed proc~stream_for_pcg32->proc~splitmix64_seed proc~stream_seed stream_seed proc~stream_for_pcg32->proc~stream_seed proc~stream_for_splitmix64->proc~splitmix64_seed proc~stream_for_splitmix64->proc~stream_seed proc~mix64 mix64 proc~splitmix64_next->proc~mix64 proc~u64_add u64_add proc~splitmix64_next->proc~u64_add proc~stream_seed->proc~mix64 proc~stream_seed->proc~u64_add proc~u64_mul u64_mul proc~stream_seed->proc~u64_mul proc~mix64->proc~u64_mul proc~u64_shr u64_shr proc~mix64->proc~u64_shr Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Module Procedures private  subroutine stream_for_splitmix64 (master_seed, stream_id, gen) Build the SplitMix64 generator belonging to stream_id . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer(kind=int64), intent(in) :: master_seed integer(kind=default_int), intent(in) :: stream_id type( splitmix64_t ), intent(out) :: gen private  subroutine stream_for_pcg32 (master_seed, stream_id, gen) Build the PCG32 generator belonging to stream_id .