:"interface/next_exponential_int.html"},{"title":"next_poisson_int – PIC","text":"public interface next_poisson_int Draw a Poisson-distributed count with mean mean_milli/1000 . The mean is given a thousand times over so that fractional means are\nexpressible without a real type: mean_milli = 2500 means 2.5 events. Counts the exponential inter-arrivals that fit inside a fixed window,\nwhich is the defining construction of a Poisson process rather than\nan approximation of one. Cost is O(mean). mean_milli must be in [0, POISSON_MAX_MEAN_MILLI] . Zero returns\nzero without consuming a draw. Out of range returns zero and, if err is present, sets ERROR_VALIDATION . Calls interface~~next_poisson_int~~CallsGraph interface~next_poisson_int next_poisson_int proc~pcg32_next_poisson_int pcg32_next_poisson_int interface~next_poisson_int->proc~pcg32_next_poisson_int proc~splitmix64_next_poisson_int splitmix64_next_poisson_int interface~next_poisson_int->proc~splitmix64_next_poisson_int proc~error_set error_t%error_set proc~pcg32_next_poisson_int->proc~error_set proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int pcg32_next_exponential_int proc~pcg32_next_poisson_int->proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int proc~splitmix64_next_poisson_int->proc~error_set proc~splitmix64_next_exponential_int splitmix64_next_exponential_int proc~splitmix64_next_poisson_int->proc~splitmix64_next_exponential_int proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int->proc~error_set proc~pcg32_next_u64 pcg32_t%pcg32_next_u64 proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int->proc~pcg32_next_u64 proc~scale_by_mean scale_by_mean proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int->proc~scale_by_mean proc~u64_shr u64_shr proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int->proc~u64_shr proc~splitmix64_next_exponential_int->proc~error_set proc~splitmix64_next_exponential_int->proc~scale_by_mean proc~splitmix64_next_u64 splitmix64_t%splitmix64_next_u64 proc~splitmix64_next_exponential_int->proc~splitmix64_next_u64 proc~splitmix64_next_exponential_int->proc~u64_shr proc~pcg32_step pcg32_step proc~pcg32_next_u64->