ests. integer ( int64 ), intent ( in ) :: a integer ( int64 ), intent ( in ) :: b logical :: r integer ( int64 ), parameter :: SIGN_BIT = ishft ( 1_int64 , 63 ) r = ieor ( a , SIGN_BIT ) < ieor ( b , SIGN_BIT ) end function u64_less","tags":"","url":"proc/u64_less.html"},{"title":"u64_mul – PIC","text":"public pure function u64_mul(a, b) result(r) (a * b) reduced modulo 2**64, without ever overflowing a signed\n64-bit integer. Schoolbook multiplication on 16-bit limbs: each partial product is\nbelow 2 32 and at most four of them plus a carry are accumulated, so\nevery intermediate stays below 2 35 and signed overflow is impossible\nregardless of the sign of the inputs. Limbs are extracted with ibits (bit-model, sign-safe) and the result is reassembled with ior / ishft . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer(kind=int64), intent(in) :: a integer(kind=int64), intent(in) :: b Return Value integer(kind=int64) Called by proc~~u64_mul~~CalledByGraph proc~u64_mul u64_mul proc~mix64 mix64 proc~mix64->proc~u64_mul proc~pcg32_step pcg32_step proc~pcg32_step->proc~u64_mul proc~stream_seed stream_seed proc~stream_seed->proc~u64_mul proc~stream_seed->proc~mix64 proc~pcg32_next pcg32_t%pcg32_next proc~pcg32_next->proc~pcg32_step proc~pcg32_next_u64 pcg32_t%pcg32_next_u64 proc~pcg32_next_u64->proc~pcg32_step proc~pcg32_seed pcg32_t%pcg32_seed proc~pcg32_seed->proc~pcg32_step proc~splitmix64_next splitmix64_t%splitmix64_next proc~splitmix64_next->proc~mix64 proc~stream_for_pcg32 stream_for_pcg32 proc~stream_for_pcg32->proc~stream_seed proc~stream_for_pcg32->proc~splitmix64_next proc~stream_for_splitmix64 stream_for_splitmix64 proc~stream_for_splitmix64->proc~stream_seed interface~stream_for stream_for interface~stream_for->proc~stream_for_pcg32 interface~stream_for->proc~stream_for_splitmix64 proc~pcg32_next_below pcg32_next_below proc~pcg32_next_below->proc~pcg32_next_u64 proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int pcg32_next_exponential_int proc~pcg32_next_exponential_int->pr