guments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer(kind=int64), intent(inout) :: state real(kind=sp), intent(in) :: value Value to encode; may be any value including -0.0, NaN and +/-Inf. Calls proc~~feed_real_sp64~~CallsGraph proc~feed_real_sp64 feed_real_sp64 proc~feed_real_record64 feed_real_record64 proc~feed_real_sp64->proc~feed_real_record64 proc~feed_integer64 feed_integer64 proc~feed_real_record64->proc~feed_integer64 proc~fnv1a_byte64 fnv1a_byte64 proc~feed_integer64->proc~fnv1a_byte64 proc~u64_add u64_add proc~fnv1a_byte64->proc~u64_add Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Called by proc~~feed_real_sp64~~CalledByGraph proc~feed_real_sp64 feed_real_sp64 proc~update64_csp_0 array_hash64_t%update64_csp_0 proc~update64_csp_0->proc~feed_real_sp64 proc~update64_csp_1 array_hash64_t%update64_csp_1 proc~update64_csp_1->proc~feed_real_sp64 proc~update64_rsp_0 array_hash64_t%update64_rsp_0 proc~update64_rsp_0->proc~feed_real_sp64 proc~update64_rsp_1 array_hash64_t%update64_rsp_1 proc~update64_rsp_1->proc~feed_real_sp64 none~update~2 array_hash64_t%update none~update~2->proc~update64_csp_0 none~update~2->proc~update64_csp_1 none~update~2->proc~update64_rsp_0 none~update~2->proc~update64_rsp_1 proc~update64_cdp_2 array_hash64_t%update64_cdp_2 none~update~2->proc~update64_cdp_2 proc~update64_cdp_3 array_hash64_t%update64_cdp_3 none~