_state_hash","tags":"","url":"proc/particle_soa_state_hash.html"},{"title":"particle_soa_state_hash64 – PIC","text":"private  function particle_soa_state_hash64(this) result(digest) 64-bit FNV-1a digest of the container’s live state. Byte for byte the same stream as state_hash : the schema string, the\nelement count as an explicit int64 , then every field’s live slice in\ndeclaration order. Only the digest width differs. Prefer this one when digests are used as identifiers rather than\ncompared pairwise – a determinism log keyed by digest, or\ndeduplicating identical states. Among 10**5 distinct 32-bit digests\nthe chance that some pair collides is about 69%; at 64 bits it is\n3e-10. Type Bound particle_soa_t Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( particle_soa_t ), intent(in) :: this Container to fingerprint. Return Value integer(kind=int64) Calls proc~~particle_soa_state_hash64~~CallsGraph proc~particle_soa_state_hash64 particle_soa_t%particle_soa_state_hash64 interface~soa_hash_begin soa_hash_begin proc~particle_soa_state_hash64->interface~soa_hash_begin interface~soa_hash_field soa_hash_field proc~particle_soa_state_hash64->interface~soa_hash_field proc~array_hash64_digest array_hash64_t%array_hash64_digest proc~particle_soa_state_hash64->proc~array_hash64_digest proc~soa_hash_begin_32 soa_hash_begin_32 interface~soa_hash_begin->proc~soa_hash_begin_32 proc~soa_hash_begin_64 soa_hash_begin_64 interface~soa_hash_begin->proc~soa_hash_begin_64 proc~soa_hash64_int32_field soa_hash64_int32_field interface~soa_hash_field->proc~soa_hash64_int32_field proc~soa_hash64_int64_field soa_hash64_int64_field interface~soa_hash_field->proc~soa_hash64_int64_field proc~soa_hash64_logical_field soa_hash64_logical_field interface~soa_hash_field->proc~soa_hash64_logical_field proc~soa_hash64_real_dp_field soa_hash64_real_dp_field interface~soa_hash_field->proc~soa_hash64_real_dp_field proc~soa_hash64_real_sp_field soa_hash64_real_sp_field interface~soa_hash_field->proc~